OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 323 Wed 25 NovC02:25/01
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/5 
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CTwo Cumbrians signed up for sports     
OL,4,Cdevelopment programme                  
OL,6,FAlice Maddams said: "I'd like to get   
OL,7,Fto the under-18 World Championships    
OL,8,Fand I would like to win the English    
OL,9,Fschools.                               
OL,11,F"I would also like to get to the       
OL,12,FCommonwealth Games when I am older."   
OL,14,FAlice's mum, Pippa Maddams, said:      
OL,15,F"Being recognised as a younger athlete 
OL,16,FI think is really important for        
OL,17,Fanyones sporting progress so she feels 
OL,18,Fpart of it and the people in the gym   
OL,19,Fknow her.                              
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBBorder SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,324,350,250,120,0,100
PN,32303
SC,0003
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 323 Wed 25 NovC02:25/01
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/5 
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CTwo Cumbrians signed up for sports     
OL,4,Cdevelopment programme                  
OL,6,F"It is part of that extended           
OL,7,Fcommunity."                            
OL,9,FSixteen-year-old Jack Bailey has also  
OL,10,Fjoined the programme. A standout at    
OL,11,Fthe Workington Reds academy for four   
OL,12,Fyears, he's picked up multiple         
OL,13,FCoaches' Player of the Year awards     
OL,14,Fwhile competing in the Junior Premier  
OL,15,FLeague.                                
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBBorder SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,324,350,250,120,0,100
PN,32304
SC,0004
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 323 Wed 25 NovC02:25/01
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/5 
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CTwo Cumbrians signed up for sports     
OL,4,Cdevelopment programme                  
OL,6,FHe said: "It is a great experience to  
OL,7,Fbe a sporting champion, it definitely  
OL,8,Fgives me more motivation. With the gym 
OL,9,Fequipment and being in a new           
OL,10,Fenvironment it is going to help me get 
OL,11,Fbetter."                               
OL,13,FHis mum Alison is delighted to see her 
OL,14,Fson welcomed onto the programme.       
OL,16,FShe said: "Being involved in the       
OL,17,Fscheme is good for the kids,           
OL,18,Fespecially Jack. You feel valued as a  
OL,19,Fsportsperson and from a parents point  
OL,20,Fof view it is good because it saves    
OL,21,Fthe parents a little bit of money."    
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
